{"id":"2101530651837055091","authorId":"1871673438","createdAt":"2026-09-20T04:35:26.000Z","type":"tweet","refId":null,"lang":"en","text":"Happy National Gymnastics Day!\n\nNo doubt, this sport made me who I am today. It taught me to be agile, committed, and undeterred in the face of a challenge. Today and every day, I’m so grateful for this foundation and for the incredible team I've had cheering me on along the way. https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd","capturedAt":"2026-09-20T05:12:27.939Z","metricsAtCapture":{"likes":3,"retweets":2,"replies":0,"quotes":0},"source":{"version":1,"url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2101530651837055091","textField":"text","raw":{"text":"Happy National Gymnastics Day!\n\nNo doubt, this sport made me who I am today. It taught me to be agile, committed, and undeterred in the face of a challenge. Today and every day, I’m so grateful for this foundation and for the incredible team I've had cheering me on along the way. https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd","entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/RUlE1yMGNd","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EmiliaSykesOH/status/2101530651837055091/photo/1","media_key":"3_2101530315026059264","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/RUlE1yMGNd","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EmiliaSykesOH/status/2101530651837055091/photo/1","media_key":"3_2101530388174684160","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/RUlE1yMGNd","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EmiliaSykesOH/status/2101530651837055091/photo/1","media_key":"3_2101530475353309184","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/RUlE1yMGNd","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EmiliaSykesOH/status/2101530651837055091/photo/1","media_key":"3_2101530537336705024","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/RUlE1yMGNd"}]},"created_at":"2026-09-20T04:35:26.000Z","conversation_id":"2101530651837055091","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101530651837055091"]},"urls":[{"field":"entities","url":"http